{"3418920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Urbanism", "steam_appid": 3418920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Feature List</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>URBANISM</strong> is a first-person horror investigation game built around exploration, tension, and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You enter large, abandoned environments with a simple objective: investigate the area, complete a series of tasks, and find a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something is hunting you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You cannot see the entities with your own eyes. Your video camera can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The camera becomes your only way of detecting what is around you. What looks like an empty hallway may reveal something standing only a few meters away when viewed through the screen. Use it carefully, watch your surroundings, and learn when it is safe to move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage requires you to explore the environment and complete multiple objectives before an escape route becomes available. While you search for what you need, the entity is constantly looking for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first large map is already in development, with <strong>many more environments planned for the future</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore large, atmospheric environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate strange locations while completing multiple objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a handheld video camera to detect entities invisible to the naked eye.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alert as the entity hunts you throughout the map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for items and interact with the environment to progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run can play out differently through randomized elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More maps and locations planned.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep your camera ready. You never know what is standing in front of you.</strong></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entities hunting you cannot be seen with the naked eye. Your video camera is the only way to reveal them. What appears to be an empty corridor, room, or street may show something entirely different through the camera's screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your camera to track what is following you, stay aware of your surroundings, and decide when to move, hide, or run.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entities hunting you cannot be seen with the naked eye. Your video camera is the only way to reveal them. What appears to be an empty corridor, room, or street may show something entirely different through the camera's screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your camera to track what is following you, stay aware of your surroundings, and decide when to move, hide, or run.</p>", "short_description": "Explore abandoned environments, complete objectives, and survive an entity you cannot see with your own eyes. Your only advantage is a video camera that reveals what is hunting you.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418920/291f16f391b1f556f454044b810adc7f5e633ca2/header.jpg?t=1787047281", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418920/f27f1884e246affbac1a400a21fa6feb429efb4d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787047281", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418920/f27f1884e246affbac1a400a21fa6feb429efb4d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787047281", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windo